OL,5,G0320 The Great House Revival
OL,6,     F26-year-old Kieran is determined
OL,7,     Fto buck the trend of leaving rural
OL,8,     FKerry to find work and a home by
OL,9,     Ftaking on the ambitious challenge
OL,10,     Fof renovating his Grandmother's
OL,11,     Fold cottage.
OL,12,G0415 Cheap European Homes
OL,13,     FMaggie helps Orla find her dream
OL,14,     Fhome in Italy, where she can work
OL,15,     Fremotely and Kevin takes her to an
OL,16,     Fexpat Italian language group to
OL,17,     Fhelp her prepare for the move.
OL,18,G0505 Saol An Treidlia
OL,19,     FSaol an Treidlia follows
OL,20,     FVeterinary surgeons Emma, John and
OL,21,     FLiam as they deal with
OL,22,     Funpredictable and difficult cases.
